{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_086f898a17059924faa1d4771f665f96c4e2a3db45584d5cd2c852d64355e6bb"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project is a single Rust crate with source under src/, including agent, session, permission, ui, context, and config modules; the TUI is custom on crossterm without ratatui."},{"claim_ids":["clm_554651672dc1cb2fea8824f44ec80296b586c644f10a545663483beb814a18fd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Core dependencies include rig 0.39, clap 4, crossterm 0.29, tokio, serde, pulldown-cmark, regex, reqwest, and mimalloc; optional features add rmcp (MCP) and agent-client-protocol (ACP)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_99ae4ebf9a0c929a178f2b2f2ec7bc5c3d90e96c7c94d0b7aedbee71df455c15"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Sessions are saved as JSON under $XDG_DATA_HOME/zerostack/sessions/ and can be resumed with -c, -r, or --session <id>; auto-compaction summarizes old messages near the context-window limit."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a87e4289fb44c49fd9feb8892a2c8f7a5123517cecd82802b2d23e074e6dfee9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Provider abstraction uses type-erased enums (AnyClient/AnyModel/AnyAgent) instead of trait objects, and tokio runs single-threaded by default unless the multithread feature is enabled."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f5b1127ab69be0b28108aab81240fb1b93d4b9994be2eab2961f9e7d421f4238"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: unit tests live in src/tests/ and headless TUI-loop integration tests drive the real loop with a FakeBackend and mock agent models, without a terminal or network."}],"claim_ids":["clm_086f898a17059924faa1d4771f665f96c4e2a3db45584d5cd2c852d64355e6bb","clm_554651672dc1cb2fea8824f44ec80296b586c644f10a545663483beb814a18fd","clm_99ae4ebf9a0c929a178f2b2f2ec7bc5c3d90e96c7c94d0b7aedbee71df455c15","clm_a87e4289fb44c49fd9feb8892a2c8f7a5123517cecd82802b2d23e074e6dfee9","clm_f5b1127ab69be0b28108aab81240fb1b93d4b9994be2eab2961f9e7d421f4238"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:09Z","created_by_operation":"op_4cbdd047c3d84f04af7844b2bfb5955b","id":"pg_f165efd6f6b552a4876c02c6c97ee874","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/gi-dellav-zerostack-architecture-md-efd142b3ac46-02c6c97ee874.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_4686454d9b635fd19cf9705fc971d56a"],"title":"gi-dellav/zerostack/ARCHITECTURE.md @ efd142b3ac46","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:09Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4cbdd047c3d84f04af7844b2bfb5955b"}
